   "intro": "*A banner across the gate, hand-painted: NO EVOLVED POKÉMON. NO EXCEPTIONS. YES, WE CHECK.*\n\n**Official, a very serious man with a clipboard, Mr. Prendergast:** \"Three entrants. First-stage. I will be weighing them.\"\n\n*The bracket on the fence: children, grandparents, Prendergast himself, and at the bottom, last year's champion.*\n\n**A girl with a Sunkern, Tansy-Jane:** \"It's never lost. I don't know why either.\"",
   "choices": [
    {
     "label": "Enter.",
     "success": {
      "text": "Prendergast hands you a pen. It is, you notice, also on a string.",
      "effects": [
       {
        "kind": "gn",
        "op": "stampRegion",
        "key": "lc-at"
       },
       {
        "kind": "gn",
        "op": "scene",
        "key": "gn-new-27-pick"
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "label": "Walk on.",
     "success": {
      "text": "Through the fence, somebody small is already cheering. You hear it for a long time.",
      "effects": []
     }
    }
   ]
  },
