   },
   "intro": "The Sunkern is beaten. Nobody quite believes it, least of all Tansy-Jane, who stands very still for a moment and then, helplessly, laughs.\n\nPrendergast hands you the Little Cup himself. It is smaller than you expected. It is heavier than it looks.",
